    graphPosition: {x: 610.2039, y: 270.38068}
  - message: 'Not a bad idea at all. The next rule, Rule 5: You must pay even closer
      attention to the sounds than before'
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 3
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 910.2039, y: 270.38068}
  - message: 
    isPlayer: 1
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies:
    - replyText: I've followed every single thing you ordered. What more do you want
        from me?
      nextNode: 11
    - replyText: Just tell me, what do I have to do this time to survive?
      nextNode: 4
    nextNode: -1
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 1210.2039, y: 270.38068}
  - message: Hold onto the sacred thread and keep walking. If you hear the sound
      of the Ching (Thai cymbal), stop immediately
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 5
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 1496.6771, y: 400.2073}
  - message: and only continue walking once it goes silent
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 6
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 1808.1057, y: 471.6359}
  - message: Listen carefully to the bell sound as you walk and count it properly
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 7
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 2108.1057, y: 471.6359}
  - message: The 3rd bell chime is the signal for you to return and sit at the pavilion
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 8
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 2408.1057, y: 471.6359}
  - message: If you return too early or too late even once... you won't get to return
      again
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 9
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 2708.1057, y: 471.6359}
  - message: Do not let go of your hand for too long, and no matter what you hear
      behind you, ignore it.
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 10
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 3008.1057, y: 471.6359}
  - message: 23:00 - 23:40, listen carefully to distinguish which sound is real
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: -1
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 3308.1057, y: 471.6359}
  - message: That red thread is the only thing binding you here
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 12
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 1510.963, y: 212.35017}
  - message: If you want to let go, then let go
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 13
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 1810.963, y: 212.35017}
  - message: But don't expect anyone to wait for you to hold it again
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: -1
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
